        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMRC32, Single Cylinder Marcel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Marcel Single Cylinder Square Deadbolt is available in only the most modern finishes. The Single Cylinder Marcel Deadbolt is from the Yale Expressions Series--which was designed with the end user in mind. This deadbolt lock is easy to install because the front door lock will fit most pre-drilled doors. The modern, square shape makes it ideal for adding a contemporary look to any residential door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Yale Expressions Marcel Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-7/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMRC32-specifications.pdf?v=1704262432\"><b>Yale YMRC32 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
