                "description": "The Marcel Single Cylinder Square Deadbolt is available in only the most modern finishes. The Single Cylinder Marcel Deadbolt is from the Yale Expressions Series--which was designed with the end user in mind. This deadbolt lock is easy to install because the front door lock will fit most pre-drilled doors. The modern, square shape makes it ideal for adding a contemporary look to any residential door.",
